http = component "HTTP interfaces" {
metadata {
 harness_id "5619f950-f538-4420-a8e1-8e5dbe296c42"
 brief "Authenticated HTTP route mapping, CSRF/origin write verification and desktop-only conversation filesystem/Git access. Conversation archive listing and lifecycle writes map shared contracts through existing authentication and CSRF/origin guards. History/event cursors are scoped to the conversation; child cancellation uses the existing write guards. PUT conversation title maps authenticated CSRF/origin-protected writes to the application rename operation and shared summary response. Conversation SSE maps application observations to credentialed live reads with latest-only backpressure, heartbeat session checks and connection-scoped cleanup. Authenticated workbench Agent transcript reads support an opt-in messages view with the same scope and cursors as the default full response. The fork endpoint validates an authenticated write with a stable target conversation identity. Versioned conversation/goal answers and explicit interrupted-question recovery use the existing authenticated CSRF/origin write guards and application scope checks. The authenticated goal detail route accepts summary and map page views. Agent list cursors carry the workbench and optional goal scope."
 source "fact"
 status "verified"
 evidence "d8f1b579-a4c5-4ab4-a8df-51c8728fbc96 529363b4-ba83-4f8c-946f-579a736f0406 3a9f444d-04a7-43d1-9a57-0212eeda58ca c3ae40e3-2672-4b92-b011-b2ef3c6044a8 85510374-7cb2-43c6-a869-078374bb0c88 886b35a7-9f5d-47fb-b555-4a774d237d50 2cf215ea-bf39-4ead-a1d5-70c2133ae170 25d2574d-1c15-4d09-85d8-982d6df10500 b97d6815-68b0-46df-b44e-372fecf0b337 84fb4077-4a9e-444a-8c06-146bdeaff8c4 f623d6c3-9885-47ae-a992-8d6a1c9e8e25"
 version "10"
}
}
composition = component "Runtime composition" {
metadata {
 harness_id "e6c5c10e-00a0-463c-b414-08b647077758"
 brief "Wires workers, services and adapters. Conversation turns use concurrent outbox delivery; explicit Git operations use a separate serial dispatcher with repository leases. Graceful shutdown closes turn and Git admission before aborting engines and preserves unstarted conversation messages; emergency stop cancels them. A separate child dispatcher allows parent settlement without blocking child delivery. Worker start, emergency stop and close control calls have deadlines and reject stale replies without automatic restart. Remote command composition reuses the existing conversation service with a minimal safe selector catalog. Development can bind the same explicit loopback port that Vite proxies, for both normal and recovery listeners. A dedicated background outbox integrates scoped historical memory with production Joi, Workbench and Pi Partner boundaries. Startup reconciles prior Turns and dispatch claims before the first runtime scheduling tick. A single durable question service is injected into conversation/Pi, HTTP and paired commands; its timer retries goal-answer projection, and graceful shutdown first settles conversation/child interruption, then closes the question timer/waiters before the remaining runtime drain. The shared WAL read Worker serves Agent lists as well as home and goal detail projections, and legacy goal questions are imported during writer startup recovery."
 source "fact"
 status "verified"
 evidence "6c84adef-da3b-49e2-8c3c-3162e41cb524 8d9826b0-5e9d-43c8-b4c4-5e247ac56d15 aeb013b6-fda3-401d-88ca-e6464dcd5bba 0928551c-008e-4486-b324-fdd3cc15e717 313dd958-6c17-4b51-8f69-c45004e29137 c3ae40e3-2672-4b92-b011-b2ef3c6044a8 e17342c4-7a41-4245-bbe9-b02def3930fc 3ed7ea76-20a9-424b-b16f-32b73d6dfded ef2d4aee-7a09-4ed9-a51b-768a2d911a92 eb72ebe5-3ff0-4346-bd46-ba89d8d592b9 505875ad-e83c-4b6f-bdd0-847face7b34c 8b8806b3-9b95-4479-bb95-2dafdcf53b5f 30fe893b-d2e3-4b80-b68f-7f61274be3d1"
 version "13"
}
}
application = component "Application services" {
metadata {
 harness_id "3c08dc1c-527b-456b-999b-8982b0ada159"
 brief "Orchestrates inbox, goals, work, automation and learning. User-driven conversations retain single-turn exclusion and checkpointed tool permissions but acquire no autonomous workspace lease. Conversation lifecycle actions start no execution; explicit Git mutations retain repository admission. Safe native-tool lifecycle facts survive normalization into conversation entries. Conversation execution also owns canonical private sessions and child lifecycle; autonomous scheduling remains separate. Conversation-only activity merges with streamed/final snapshots and is retained through terminal failures; pending projection writes drain before completion. Work event kinds remain unchanged. Typed Pi latency diagnostic contracts expose safe scalar lifecycle facts. Conversation observations publish only committed safe projections and keep transport concerns outside the application. Paired remote commands reuse conversation services and existing connection-scoped paging rather than introducing another execution chain. Work planning exposes resource-wait phases to the foreman and preserves queued work unless cancellation has an explicit intent. Explicitly pinned Pi partners require a current READY source before a new plan is persisted; source failures project actionable configuration without hiding the partner catalog or gating native engines. Foreman candidate lists exclude disabled and action-required partners while management keeps their records. Method learning persists 60/120-second retry backoff, three-failure stops and explicit pause facts. Sample waiting releases execution while preserving scope/profile reservations, five-group readiness, development cost gates and conditional comparison feedback. Real-provider benefit and extended replay remain unverified. Protocol preflight accepts valid evidence ordering independently of answer quality. Two invalid responses reject only their experiment while preserving defect evidence and daily automatic retry limits. Synthesis validates private evidence before declaring completion and before the outcome transaction. Synthesis reuses qualifying evidence for individually unchanged requirements and returns scoped private correction facts. Exhausted coverage correction can open one read-only disposition pass; a persisted continuation uses the existing review budget. Completion declarations carry no external execution effect. Durable scheduling stops deterministic failures and preserves transient retry budgets. Safe uncommitted synthesis drafts permit configured fallback replacement. Foreman planning uses explicit producer-before-review dependencies; independent Work remains parallel and dependent reviews wait for every successful producer. Leased engine cancellation waits for actual execution settlement before resource completion. Workbench Agent queries delegate full transcript and message-only reads to their repository with shared paging defaults. Historical memory organization consumes durable settlement events. Joi, Workbench and Partner histories have independent owners and compaction triggers. At a trigger, the settlement job attempts to compact old facts before appending complete additions. Reusable Partner experience is shared across Workbenches. Evidence synthesis retains bounded mandatory context and validates plain-text completion with the same current coverage rules. Durable user questions are a separate application boundary shared by ordinary Pi conversations and goals; goal continuation still requires its existing explicit recovery review and gate."
 source "fact"
 status "verified"
 evidence "70cfe0d8-8277-4d50-a38e-99188dc3d467 ab916d87-3ab3-4619-9f69-ce1f640aae6d a984c882-2ef4-40fc-a9a5-dca9f6ce824e 02183363-905c-43b4-9579-4b7dd225d966 8d9826b0-5e9d-43c8-b4c4-5e247ac56d15 529363b4-ba83-4f8c-946f-579a736f0406 d07c943c-dd56-49b1-8fad-3ad61f4df6cc 313dd958-6c17-4b51-8f69-c45004e29137 c3ae40e3-2672-4b92-b011-b2ef3c6044a8 b2a4acb0-0d03-490d-8118-9f905e528312 44b4de62-537a-42f1-8a5c-40d72900430b a138a736-c367-4480-8655-8a70cd6b1091 eeed5019-b62d-454f-9699-f461331a8fde 7248e4e7-328d-4d19-9d07-c7552695b8a5 ffbbdd29-0a69-4db5-87ff-fcd20d74a1c2 d163a01d-2706-4679-8bea-de546e1ead3a d350b327-9a09-447e-9b5e-005388a94107 dd14b77b-3e78-4d08-8012-39d32d8e2aef 0a318b41-99e0-4705-bcf0-b2157afc5f8c 0139295d-c933-4f90-8dbe-e817016f1e65 0423a1b2-bacf-4268-aacc-a5b27b920a66 54924ed6-1441-4f5d-a175-47b16eae6fbc d64591f6-724e-4892-b3bb-602f4a1be477 251779e1-a5cc-4fda-a221-f895d44d0c88 9cddc3d6-d91f-44e5-b7dc-541889c8d24e 972b280a-98e7-48be-b81e-9086e58d83a3 e8632c11-c82b-419b-8d13-3011c3a11f74 3fae164b-6d25-46cc-b322-eb68160aeeed 6672eee3-54eb-4cc2-a30d-73ac1065a1c5 27776754-b9ce-4f88-a876-8e4f93a4c79d 4a3894d3-e2b3-4f1e-b87d-4063b3a99dc4 341157d6-1d6e-4219-b91d-b159f418d573 4b18689f-6b0f-410b-a946-5b7479e53b33 451b17f1-11fa-490a-8fdf-2c76ffe9ae95 e7eee0d5-5c5b-4a2f-90fa-82412fcd041c"
 version "24"
}
remote = component "Paired remote commands" {
metadata {
 harness_id "a3484361-8b3f-4bed-aabb-5034c3bc381c"
 brief "Validates and dispatches the paired normal conversation allowlist to existing application services. Safe catalogs and connection-scoped bounded pages reuse the current command protocol. Sends preserve application request identities and use the existing outbox; local filesystem, Git and arbitrary HTTP operations stay outside this interface. Scoped question answers and explicit conversation recovery reuse the same durable application services and bounded responses; unavailable hosts return an upgrade-required refusal."
 source "fact"
 status "verified"
 evidence "a138a736-c367-4480-8655-8a70cd6b1091 eeed5019-b62d-454f-9699-f461331a8fde 7248e4e7-328d-4d19-9d07-c7552695b8a5 ffbbdd29-0a69-4db5-87ff-fcd20d74a1c2"
 version "2"
}
}
questions = component "Durable user questions" {
metadata {
 harness_id "b068e408-97c0-4479-bd9e-446609066663"
 brief "Application-owned goal/conversation question lifecycle normalizes prompts and recommendations, validates scoped versioned answers and delegates FIFO/CAS to its store. Pending ACTIVE cards have a 30-minute deadline. The SQLite answer transaction checks delivery and host time; interruption frees the slot and leaves the card available for explicit recovery. Saved manual, chosen-default and timeout-default answers remain distinct from delivery. Waiters and observers do not own durable truth. Cancellation revokes cards; startup retains interrupted conversation answers for explicit recovery and retries unapplied goal answers. Public DTOs sanitize text and omit private tool/action/Work/run bindings. Defaults confer no additional permissions. Native engine and arbitrary A2A question bridges are outside this implementation."
 source "fact"
 status "verified"
 evidence "e7eee0d5-5c5b-4a2f-90fa-82412fcd041c cafb487c-1322-4fa7-8b48-6befd1004499 66be0606-2df5-4ca3-81ea-40fbf6a62599 5cc8dd07-5b08-4c9e-a9da-fc71b178abaa"
 version "1"
}
}
conversations = component "Conversation execution" {
metadata {
 harness_id "cad6c097-c1e0-468e-9195-6e4005ccec71"
 brief "User-driven turns preserve workbench ownership and immutable configuration. Same partner capabilities reuse a segment; switching creates an idempotent successor with a complete handoff, including A1-B1-A2. Conversation deliveries overlap across conversations, with one running owner per conversation. Current intent defines the task; prior turns are reference facts. Pi receives full authorized tools initially, native permission continuation remains. Committed safe activity, metadata-only titles, remote contracts, Git leases and durable child ownership remain separate. Forks persist a private selected-turn handoff and start execution only on the first new user message. Ordinary Pi questions keep the same turn RUNNING with separate waitingForUser state; committed cards survive SSE/cursor reads and paged history. Stop and child cancellation revoke owned cards. Cold boot marks unconsumed questions interrupted without fabricating tool results. Explicit recovery links each idempotent attempt to the original turn, retaining the full private request and answers and requiring unknown-effect verification. Failed attempts allow a new explicit retry. Successful settlement acknowledges the original answers and streams that updated original turn with the recovery result. Only the selected unanswered card adopts its displayed default; other unanswered cards are explicitly left for re-questioning. Graceful shutdown preserves parent/child interruption instead of user cancellation."
 source "fact"
 status "verified"
 evidence "d07c943c-dd56-49b1-8fad-3ad61f4df6cc 313dd958-6c17-4b51-8f69-c45004e29137 c3ae40e3-2672-4b92-b011-b2ef3c6044a8 b2a4acb0-0d03-490d-8118-9f905e528312 a5c69e17-9313-458e-952d-24dbb17852ef 44b4de62-537a-42f1-8a5c-40d72900430b ee49fdc6-1c1c-48a7-a1ee-afa121d0b174 a417be0f-3af1-4139-a6fb-d1db010ac491 5cc8dd07-5b08-4c9e-a9da-fc71b178abaa"
 version "13"
}
}
}
domain = component "Domain policies" {
metadata {
 harness_id "b48eb196-1e32-4244-9cb1-070336a79f17"
 brief "Pure TypeScript admission and validation. Local browser tools that launch processes or execute page scripts require WRITE. Unknown names stay denied and custom partner minimum access reflects these effects. Local Git inspection is READ; unrestricted shell and mutations retain exclusive WRITE admission. Resource-wait cancellation requires an explicit intent. Method experience extraction uses validated numeric development comparisons and registered policies; identical or incomplete comparisons create no lesson. Shared turn recovery policy classifies exhausted synthesis correction, non-repeating source failures, failure budgets and replay permission. Directory admission honors earlier incompatible read/write requests and allows consecutive readers. Independent 5,000, 20,000 and 1,000 Unicode character budgets render concise historical sections and source references."
 source "fact"
 status "verified"
 evidence "246218d7-0c42-468a-b979-615c8ca1525d 2bee49b0-f04c-4ce2-8f64-79516009c1e9 c3ae40e3-2672-4b92-b011-b2ef3c6044a8 d6797abc-d945-4aa6-bc1a-49d0558529bc 3e39b216-1a95-41a5-a236-1dfece37d9f8 61e0cd00-7284-40f2-9e5d-0a7d4bb0c7de f28b28ea-c8d1-4aca-a65d-383bebe86300 f1be38d3-6986-4482-842c-385096d1c6e2 f098c9d0-a6f7-49bd-a284-d7924445bcd7 cc1776fb-b429-4c12-880f-09bd1e93aeaf"
 version "11"
}
}
infrastructure = component "Infrastructure adapters" {
metadata {
 harness_id "05a7cbd5-4101-4522-a77a-16d3914b08c8"
 brief "Implements persistence, engine, A2A, security and artifact ports. Conversation state is transactional. Startup restores durable Pi results without replaying execution and clears queue backoff for unstarted turns. Explicit Git uses root-confined file adapters and repository coordination. Pinned SDK sessions, native journals and incremental conversation/child stores implement the new ports. The encrypted paired host validates conversation command shapes and advertises conversations.v1 without opening local file or Git operations. Goal Work lists expose safe resource-wait phases and canceled Work remains canceled in goal-scoped agent cards. Native CLI resolution reads Windows environment keys case-insensitively inside Workers. Work path adapters reuse linked identities, reopen recovered unresolved paths, and apply shared canonical visibility before detail paging while preserving historical rows. Method learning migration 099 preserves sample-waiting checkpoints outside the unique running/fault-paused slot without resuming historical learning. SQLite synthesis preflight is read-only and scopes earlier accepted results to unchanged requirements; the final outcome transaction remains authoritative. Pi restricts the disposition pass to inspection and completion tools. Orphan scan and redrive honor effect proof, current execution ownership and durable retry deadlines. Pi prestart requests share directory admission with native continuations. Home feed projects durable queued/retry facts and blocked unsafe synthesis as failure. Existing physical directory overlap governs a fair read/write queue. NONE creates no lease; repeat READ reuses its generation. Transactional release and queue removal wake persisted dispatch; result storage precedes release and display failures do not retain ownership. Stale generations cannot delete newer leases. Workbench Agent message-only reads check visible session and goal membership, then read a sequence page without aggregating Agent cards. Scoped native execution, model request admission and reference-only Workbench history preserve private archives. SQLite source checks and settlement receipts preserve provenance through compaction and fallback. Durable preference watermarks reject delayed changes to the same topic. Canceling a goal revokes its queued and routed children. Explicit retry after active Turns settle reopens the gate and queues only the goal. Boot recovery restores verified completions, queues safely interrupted Turns and hands acknowledged dispatches to their existing recovery path. Active goal coverage refresh reports queue and failure separately from its retained conclusion and can be explicitly retried without dispatch. Durable question storage and goal gate transactions add scoped FIFO and answer reconciliation without adding a scheduler. Authenticated paired hosts advertise questions.v1; conversation projections preserve parent ownership and independent answer/delivery states. Indexed instance history, scoped keyset pagination and transaction-versioned goal map details support large read projections. Identical in-flight Agent pages share a Worker request. Scheduled continuation reads settled goal summaries without Work bodies. New Joi and Workbench settlements carry bounded source facts. Routine admissions assign a monotone sequence reused by retries. Goal Agent access selects its recent 100 before projecting cards or transcripts. Routine history reads the newest 200 run records."
 source "fact"
 status "verified"
