mobile = component "Android client" {
metadata {
 harness_id "9bdcf527-c117-4762-86ce-c7d2e01c6321"
 brief "Flutter remote controller views with pairing and home. Internal remote transport not audited. Normal conversation views and the native controller are reviewed for conversations.v1 negotiation, shared history, stable sends, incremental reads, stop and metadata actions. Background polling pauses and stale results are ignored. Real-device direct/relay behavior remains manual. Ordinary conversations, task messages and goal follow-ups share hardware Enter and soft keyboard Send with composition protection. Partner history and ordinary replies share Flutter Markdown and paired tool rows. Wide tables scroll locally, and the partner list builds rows lazily across the existing pages. Flutter question cards render active/queued/history states, scoped drafts, defaults and delivery receipts in conversations and goal details. Conversation questions use compact forms, with default-collapsed one-line receipts that expand to the full question, answer and delivery details. Home goal actions use the compact form for pending questions. Task details and the current result reader show resolved cards in a collapsed question history. Negotiated questions.v1 gates answers and explicit recovery; older/disconnected hosts cannot submit. Saved-answer and displayed-default recovery remain distinct. Physical-device question behavior is not established by synthetic widget/encrypted-peer coverage."
 source "fact"
 status "verified"
 evidence "9eb5b925-3b08-4116-94d5-c22547df6564 4b0b84e3-24d0-44f7-aac1-2c450c507e80 5b5e2d23-0e65-499d-999d-976a1fbe3691 f8b6f0fa-14fe-4833-9554-150cfe6a6c38 4bf896c9-b798-4616-a9db-8da8c7e8980d 00eddc89-bcf1-43bd-ab95-2532ceb7d32a baccc11b-b811-475c-8ccc-299ecea71659 9e0456ed-9c75-4153-962d-c8d52b36a7b0 a0a831e5-a22b-4ab2-8275-4719a02a488a f38946e3-12db-45b8-898b-c8d8eb3bea6b 6ceede77-3a86-45a8-82fc-595a0b99b66a 37ab43f3-e18f-4b25-a291-fd5a5be547eb 5cc8dd07-5b08-4c9e-a9da-fc71b178abaa"
 version "6"
}
}
