 harness_id "5241d3d1-1758-46a9-b7db-382ba7c72645"
 brief "Non-production HTML design artifacts include Phosphor navigation icon comparisons with the user-selected Heartbeat/SquaresFour pair. Conversation prototype models independent network/partner/skill choices, chat-first workbench creation, inherited context and simulated Git with embedded diff2html; isolated from the production runtime. Portrait documentation retains the approved gold-bob over-the-shoulder portrait with ivory skin and champagne hair, its G3 source, final comparison and selected prompts. The approved portrait supplies desktop, web and Android brand assets; unused drafts remain in ignored local storage and preview pages remain outside the production runtime."
